xt\":\"meningococcal meningitis\",\"entity\":\"SpecificDisease\",\"rationale\":\"Second mention of the specific disease meningococcal meningitis in the abstract. Duplicate mentions are annotated, and the recurrent modifier is excluded as a course descriptor.\",\"guideline_section\":\"4. Annotate duplicate mentions\"},{\"start\":211,\"end\":255,\"text\":\"absence of the sixth component of complement\",\"entity\":\"SpecificDisease\",\"rationale\":\"Refers to the specific C6 deficiency condition, a single defined disease. The minimum span covers the full phrase up to complement, excluding the parenthetical abbreviation.\",\"guideline_section\":\"1. Annotate all Specific Disease mentions\"},{\"start\":258,\"end\":260,\"text\":\"C6\",\"entity\":\"SpecificDisease\",\"rationale\":\"Abbreviation given in parentheses as a synonym for the sixth component of complement deficiency. Abbreviations are annotated as a separate mention from the long form.\",\"guideline_section\":\"6. Annotate all synonymous mentions\"},{\"start\":318,\"end\":339,\"text\":\"neisserial infections\",\"entity\":\"DiseaseClass\",\"rationale\":\"Refers to a family of infections caused by Neisseria species (including meningococcal and gonococcal infections), not one specific disease, so it is a Disease Class.\",\"guideline_section\":\"1. Annotate all Specific Disease mentions (Disease Class)\"},{\"start\":343,\"end\":356,\"text\":\"C6 deficiency\",\"entity\":\"SpecificDisease\",\"rationale\":\"Names the specific condition of C6 deficiency, a single defined disease with no further categorization.\",\"guideline_section\":\"1. Annotate all Specific Disease mentions\"},{\"start\":606,\"end\":618,\"text\":\"C6-deficient\",\"entity\":\"Modifier\",\"rationale\":\"Disease mention used as an adjective modifying the noun serum, so it is annotated as a Modifier.\",\"guideline_section\":\"3. Annotate disease mentions that are used as Modifiers for other concepts\"},{\"start\":816,\"end\":837,\"text\":\"neisserial infections\",\"entity\":\"DiseaseClass\",\"rationale\":\"Second occurrence of the disease class neisserial infections, referring to a family of Neisseria-caused infections. Duplicate mentions are annotated.\",\"guideline_section\":\"4. Annotate duplicate mentions\"},{\"start\":842,\"end\":897,\"text\":\"absence of one of the late-acting complement components\",\"entity\":\"DiseaseClass\",\"rationale\":\"A grey-area term describing a family of deficiencies of late-acting complement components (C5 to C9), not one specific disease, so it is annotated as a Disease Class.\",\"guideline_section\":\"11. Grey area terms annotated as Disease Class if appropriate\"}]}", "type": "text"}], "diagnostics": null, "model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_details": null, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "stop_sequence": null, "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 3863, "output_tokens": 11578, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 10376}, "service_tier": "batch", "speed": "standard"}}}